## GPIO Pin Reference

```
ATmega328P-PU Phase 3 Pin Assignments
──────────────────────────────────────
PC4 (SDA)  → I2C — BH1750 & SSD1306
PC5 (SCL)  → I2C — BH1750 & SSD1306
PD2 (INT0) → Encoder Phase A
PD3 (INT1) → Encoder Phase B
PD4        → Encoder Switch (mode toggle + soft-power long-press)
PD5        → PWR_HOLD output (soft-power latch hold)
PC6 (RESET)→ 10 kΩ pull-up to VCC; ICSP pin
```

